    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nostalgia Redefined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready for some nostalgia? Epics of Distant Realm is an adventure game from 2006, combined with role-playing elements. Take control of a young man who has lost his memory upon crashing to a foreign world. Explore the island, clear dungeons, find loot, buy a farm and grow tomatoes. Your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Overhaul of backgrounds, while keeping the feel of the authentic look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hero movement and animation is now realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Replacing arrow controls with the modern WASD scheme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Replacing map system with the new navigation screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Introduction of hotkeys to make selections easier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rebalancing of enemies corresponding to your level stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Improved HUD and all the text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Improved dialogue with slightly better humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bug fixes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New levels and interactions to explore </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NEW GAME+ mode to increase replay value</p>",
